        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Accordingly, the parties agree to establish a supplemental retiree healthcare benefit trust to pay a portion of the cost of healthcare benefits that the Eligible Participants (who may, for purposes of this Section G, include active employees who have retired from the Company) would otherwise be required to absorb through premiums or other payments. Such trust shall be a joint labor management employee benefit fund to be known as the Lucent Welfare Benefits",
